{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/learn/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/page,_N_T_/learn/templeton-pessimism-misread"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3eaf36e367672966.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/learn/%5Bslug%5D/page-f7b99344f7e2ee16.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>鄧普頓「最悲觀時」為什麼常誤讀？3個條件｜股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"約翰·鄧普頓留下一句被傳很廣的話，大意是在別人最悲觀時尋找機會。後來被壓成「跌深就買」。少掉的是：悲觀要先被你研究成「過悲觀」，而且你要有時間與資金等到敘述改變。沒有這兩層，最悲觀只是一個感覺，感覺常出現在還能更悲觀的時候。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_wrap__LIQ8G\"><article class=\"LearnArticle_article__2nBbk\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_meta__etj_G\"><a class=\"LearnArticle_cat__GQMlg\" href=\"/learn?c=stories\">人物與市場史</a><span class=\"LearnArticle_read__QEj6a\">閱讀約 3 分鐘</span></p><h1 class=\"LearnArticle_title__0_la8\">鄧普頓「最悲觀時」為什麼常誤讀？3個條件</h1><details class=\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\"><summary class=\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\">本文目錄</summary><ol class=\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\"><li><a href=\"#sec-1\">一、句子被壓扁之後</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-2\">二、三個條件</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-3\">三、和葛拉漢市場先生的關係</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-4\">四、台股版最常見的誤用</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-5\">五、最小動作</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-6\">常見問題 FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-7\">總結</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-8\">延伸閱讀</a></li></ol></details><div class=\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\">約翰·鄧普頓留下一句被傳很廣的話，大意是在別人最悲觀時尋找機會。後來被壓成「跌深就買」。少掉的是：悲觀要先被你研究成「過悲觀」，而且你要有時間與資金等到敘述改變。沒有這兩層，最悲觀只是一個感覺，感覺常出現在還能更悲觀的時候。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\"><b class=\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\">本文重點</b><ul class=\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\"><li>最悲觀是描述群眾溫度，不是自動進場鈴</li><li>你要先講得出市場在怕什麼、怕得過不過分</li><li>沒有等待時間與流動性，便宜走不掉就不是機會</li></ul></div><section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">一、句子被壓扁之後</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">公開語境裡，這句話搭配的是主動尋找被冷落的市場與公司，而不是在任何下跌按買。壓扁成口號之後，它變成損失趨避的反面衝動：用反向證明自己比較冷靜。冷靜沒有研究，只是另一種情緒。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>口號會刪掉研究</li><li>反向可以是情緒</li><li>溫度≠進場</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">二、三個條件</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">第一，你能用自己的話寫下群眾在怕什麼。第二，你能寫下怕得過當的理由，以及你可能才是錯的那一方。第三，你能等，而且走得掉。三個少一個，就還只是口號。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>口號</th><th>條件</th><th>缺條件時</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>別人怕所以買</td><td>怕的是什麼</td><td>你只是在買下跌</td></tr><tr><td>最低點附近</td><td>你無法事前知道最低</td><td>還能更低</td></tr><tr><td>逆向就是智慧</td><td>逆向也要尺子</td><td>從眾於反向人群</td></tr><tr><td>長期會好</td><td>你的錢能長期嗎</td><td>中途被逼走</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">三、和葛拉漢市場先生的關係</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">市場先生沮喪時報低價，是邀請。鄧普頓這句是邀請的溫度計。兩句都沒有叫你每次都接受邀請。接受之前仍要能力圈與失效。</p><ol class=\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\"><li>先量溫度</li><li>再問自己懂不懂</li><li>最後問走不走得掉</li></ol><figure class=\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\">!跌深就買!當日金句按鈕!逆向等於智慧</div><figcaption class=\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\">誤讀</figcaption></figure></section><section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">四、台股版最常見的誤用</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">指數大跌那天，群組會重貼這句話。當天流動性往往最差，敘述也最整齊。整齊的悲觀可以持續很久，一九九〇年寫過。把歷史金句當當日按鈕，是把教材當月曆。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>大跌日金句最響</li><li>響的時候離開最擠</li><li>金句不當按鈕</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">五、最小動作</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">想用這句話時，先寫五十個字：他們在怕什麼、我為什麼認為過當、我能等多久。寫不滿，就先不要用這句話幫自己壯膽。</p></section><section id=\"sec-6\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">常見問題 FAQ</h2><div class=\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\"><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>恐懼時是不是比較容易有好價格？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">有時是。好價格仍要你懂、你能等、你走得掉。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>和巴菲特那句別人恐懼有何不同？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">傳播上常被當成同一句。都要配研究與時間，都不能當當日按鈕。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>用數字能測最悲觀嗎？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">溫度可以找代理變數。代理不是真理，過度配適常見。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>國際市場一起悲觀呢？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">系統性悲觀時，分散與流動性都要重估。見海嘯與塔雷伯兩篇。</p></details></div></section><section id=\"sec-7\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">總結</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">「最悲觀時」是溫度計，不是按鈕。三個條件：寫得出怕什麼、寫得出可能是你錯、寫得出能等且走得掉。</p></section><section id=\"sec-8\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">延伸閱讀</h2><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/graham-mr-market-three-checks\">葛拉漢市場先生</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/taiwan-1990-crash-what-it-still-teaches\">1990 台股萬點</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/herding-in-markets\">從眾行為</a></li></ul></section><div class=\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\">相關文章</p><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/graham-mr-market-three-checks\">葛拉漢市場先生</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/taiwan-1990-crash-what-it-still-teaches\">1990 台股萬點</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/herding-in-markets\">從眾行為</a></div></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[81259,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[89379,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[10021,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[10528,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-43